note as PRIVACY_diagram_27_identity_assurance
  MINIMIZATION AND FRAUD SAFETY
  Store hashes, references and normalized claims instead of unrestricted raw
  documents. Separate biometric templates from operational records. Record
  authority, evidence quality, assurance level, legal basis, discrepancies,
  manual review and revocation. Never treat a successful API call as identity.
end note


